ue of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids in Polk County has a record from 1951 to 2025, and June to July and August to September each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle ran 194% of normal in June to July and 27% in January to February. Every grid had its driest year in 1988, with grid 26247 lowest at 54%.</p>"}
